.TH t3unlock 1  "t3unlock 0.2.0" 
.SH NAME
t3unlock \- Unlock Samsung Portable SSD T3 on Linux (Rust).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBt3unlock\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unlock Samsung Portable SSD T3 on Linux (Rust).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
t3unlock\-status(1)
Show device presence and lock status
.TP
t3unlock\-unlock(1)
Unlock the drive (prompts for password if not provided)
.TP
t3unlock\-doctor(1)
Diagnose common Linux permission/udev issues
.TP
t3unlock\-gen\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions
.TP
t3unlock\-gen\-man(1)
Generate a man page to the given directory
.TP
t3unlock\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.2.0
